Recovery is possible via forensic tools (e.g., Cellebrite, Oxygen Forensic) before overwriting. Probability decreases with time and system activity. Government and manufacturers must enforce **mandatory secure erase**, **encryption with key destruction**, and **audit-ready wipe logs** to ensure irreversible data removal and compliance with privacy laws.

